{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1574","id":4059608887,"node_id":"PR_kwDOO5D6p87x-Lc3","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1574","diff_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1574.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1574.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1574","number":1574,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Harden Windows Hyper-V runner deployment","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What changed\n\n- records and verifies target workstation deployment for Stages 00-50\n- adds the reproducible Ubuntu 24.04 golden-image builder and evidence binding\n- installs the split unprivileged controller / fixed LocalSystem lifecycle helper\n- adds immutable RSA-signed receipt chaining and removable signer lifecycle\n- enforces the fixed 180 GiB VHDX pool, isolated-interface firewall blocks, and boot-time remount\n- creates and verifies the private trusted repository and repository-scoped controller GitHub App\n- adds a default-branch-owned fixed isolated workflow candidate with exact head SHA and fixed policy inputs\n- adds canonical YAML AST enforcement with good, bad, and mutation fixtures\n- adds App-backed repository/actor/PR/exact-head admission, JIT endpoint, fixed dispatch, token revocation, and replay-state adapters\n- pins security-boundary actions to full upstream commit SHAs\n\n## Why\n\nThe original bootstrap package was fail-closed scaffolding. Live deployment exposed target-specific requirements around localized Windows account rights, URL ACL handling, persistent seed replay evidence, Public-profile allow-rule overlap, receipt integrity, fixed VHDX remount after restart, GitHub App manifest conversion, DPAPI initialization, listener exclusivity, and exact installation verification. This PR keeps candidate code inside disposable Hyper-V guests and does not claim go-live before the remaining platform and smoke gates are true.\n\n## Current deployment state\n\n- Stages 00-50: complete with signed receipts\n- Stage 60: in progress\n- private `Samsen879/ciecopilot-trusted-ci`: created\n- GitHub App `ciecopilot-jit-runner-controller`: installed only on `Samsen879/ciecopilot-home` with the exact declared permissions\n- App ID `4304861`; installation ID `146739219`\n- App private key: DPAPI LocalMachine protected; controller read-only ACL; plaintext PEM never persisted\n- live admission positive sample: PR #1571, exact head `8bfd11abdf308be7bc8e9e85ca809ffe97015861`\n- live fail-closed sample: draft PR #1574 denied only for `draft_pull_request_denied`\n- old source-repository `ciecopilot-heavy` runners: five registrations currently offline; not yet migrated or deleted\n- trusted secret values: not copied and not exposed to the isolated PR lane\n- `automatic_pr_execution_enabled=false`\n- `go_live_authorized=false`\n\n## Validation\n\n- runtime-ready config validation: pass, zero warnings\n- target-aligned bundle validation: 114/114\n- PowerShell parse validation: pass\n- controller admission fixtures: 1 admitted + 6 denied, pass\n- isolated workflow YAML AST: canonical fixture and declared bad/mutation cases, pass\n- existing self-hosted workflow guard: 9 tests, pass\n- CI security workflow integrity: 4 tests, pass\n- live installation tokens: memory-only and explicitly revoked\n- local RSA/hash/predecessor receipt chain: 11 receipts, pass\n- `git diff --check` and staged secret scan: pass\n\n## Review notes\n\nThis remains intentionally a draft security-boundary PR. The isolated workflow is not default-branch owned until reviewed and merged. Stage 60 still needs trusted-runner/secrets separation evidence and negative scheduling proof; Stage 70 still needs a real disposable VM/JIT smoke. Do not interpret this PR as Stage 90 go-live authorization.\n","created_at":"2026-07-15T10:16:00Z","updated_at":"2026-07-16T01:30:57Z","closed_at":"2026-07-16T01:30:57Z","merged_at":"2026-07-16T01:30:57Z","merge_commit_sha":"2f1a0300971cfa93448e9641deb446d3018af730","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1574/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1574/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1574/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/statuses/eafc685c2c373f0ee9f917af8fe5b21eaedfc974","head":{"label":"Samsen879:agent/windows-hyperv-runner-deployment","ref":"agent/windows-hyperv-runner-deployment","sha":"eafc685c2c373f0ee9f917af8fe5b21eaedfc974","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://g